# Graft operator English

Operators do not speak fixture strings. Graft **interprets English**, then **does the job**, **asks one clear question**, or **explains why it cannot**.

## Decide vs clarify

- **Decide** when intent is obvious: clone/copy dashboard, rename dashboard/panel, add ML panel, even if ids vs titles vs UIDs are mixed.
- **Ask** when wording is new, unmatched, or the handler path is low-confidence. One question. Do not guess. Do not send unmatched English to the LLM to fake success (`### Done` with no save).
- **Clarify** when two actions are equally likely or a required target is missing (no machine, no uid, no dashboard name, no source panel).
- **Never** fail a complete request only because it missed a template (`copy of 2103-176030`, `uid=`).

## Accept as equivalent

- Dashboard **title** (`Skywater-FL`) = template, not only `####-######`
- Grafana **UID** (`6sFerv44k`, `uid = idHkqdqnk`) = dashboard, including “the X machine”
- Unclosed quotes, “to be X”, “instead of the current name”
- “Own history” / ±2σ / Influx ≠ RandomForest History Comparison ≠ “vs Peers”
- Do not add Grafana **alerts** unless the prompt asks for an alert
- Vendor/site words (**Keysight**, **Skywater**) are titles, never Grafana uids
- **Module N Temperature** is plant `Temperature_C`, not Module N Current
- Clone by title: exact title or `####-###### / Title` — never the first search hit that merely contains the string

## Tests

Add the **operator’s exact prompt** to `src/services/regression/graftRegressionFixtures.ts` (and `operatorPhrasingRegression.test.ts`) when a phrasing fails or should have asked.

Paraphrase bank (`writeupParaphraseBank.ts`): each run samples **valid** messy restatements (decide, including open-dashboard uid) **and** invalid/broken ones (vague, missing target, colliding, vendor-as-uid, incomplete clone) that must **Need clarification**, never fake `### Done`. Read-only questions are not unmatched jobs.

```text
❌ BAD: LLM improvises unmatched English and replies Done
✅ GOOD: Need clarification — which dashboard / which panel type / which machine
❌ BAD: "Template and target ids must be different" for copy of Skywater-FL + 2505-200033
✅ GOOD: copy of <title> + data for <machine id> → clone
```
